#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_holtrop_note_p1
msgid ""
"1.Viscosity by default is for sea water with density 1025 kg/m^3 and temperature 15 °C.\n"
"You can change the temperature and the density: Project->Project Settings->Hydrostatics\n"
msgstr ""
"1. 默认黏度对应密度为 1025 kg/m^3、温度为 15 °C 的海水。\n"
"可在“工程→工程设置→静水力”中修改温度和密度\n"

#. DeepSeek Flash review note: 俄语旧译文含“艏倾为正”的额外说明，源字符串无此内容，已按源文统一；公式与变量保持不变。
#. 长篇技术说明按原文行序逐行交由 DeepSeek Flash 翻译，保留换行；专业含义与定宽表格排版仍需复核。
#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_holtrop_note_p2
msgid "2.The trim is calculated by formulaes: dT=Tf-Ta, Tf=T+dt/2, Ta=T-dt/2\n"
msgstr "2.纵倾按以下公式计算：dT=Tf-Ta, Tf=T+dt/2, Ta=T-dt/2\n"

#. DeepSeek Flash review note: 源文“one-screw/twin-screw”指单桨/双桨；Ae/Ao
#. 为展开叶面积比（盘面比）。fr/de/es 原为空，已补译。
#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_holtrop_note_p7
msgid ""
"7.Propeller diameter D with one-screw is <= 0.8*Ta, and for twin-screw <= 0.7*Ta.\n"
"Expanded blade area ratio Ae/Ao is calculate from condition, when cavitation be absent"
msgstr ""
"7. 单桨船螺旋桨直径 D <= 0.8*Ta，双桨船 <= 0.7*Ta。\n"
"扩展叶面积比 Ae/Ao 根据不发生气蚀的条件计算"

#. DeepSeek Flash review note: 文献条目保持原文可检索；仅翻译引导句。
#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_holtrop_note_p9
msgid ""
"9.    More information about statistical Holtrop method are here:\n"
