"Shipbuilding Progress, Vol.29, No.335, July, 1982.\n"
"9.2   Holtrop J., \"A Statistical Reanalysis of Resistance and Propulsion Data, \"International\n"
"Shipbuilding Progress, Vol.31, No.363, Nov., 1984\n"

