#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_fungleib_note_p5
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_fungleib_note_p5"
msgid ""
"5.Standart deviation of database for typical resistance Fung-Leibman's method:\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|        Parameters           |      Limitations     |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"| Length/Breadth,       Lwl/B |  2.520 to 17.935     |\n"
"| Breadth/Draft,          B/T |  1.696 to 10.204     |\n"
"| Prismatic coefficient,   Cp |  0.526 to 0.774      |\n"
"| Midship coefficient,     Cm |  0.556 to 0.994      |\n"
"| Waterplane coefficient, Cwp |  0.662 to 0.841      |\n"
"| Half entrance angle,     ie |    2.6 to 31.73 degr |\n"
"| Transom area coefficient Ta |   0.00 to 0.74       |\n"
"| Transom beam coefficient Tw |   0.00 to 1.00       |\n"
"| Disp/length, DLR=V/Lwl^3    |  16.24 to 359.2      |\n"
"| Froude number, Fr           |   0.15 to 0.90       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"
msgstr ""
"5. Fung-Leibman 方法典型阻力数据库的标准偏差：\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+\n"
"|            参数             |       适用范围       |\n"
"|-----------------------------+----------------------|\n"
"|        长宽比 Lwl/B         |  2.520 to 17.935     |\n"
"|        宽吃水比 B/T         |  1.696 to 10.204     |\n"
"|         棱形系数 Cp         |  0.526 to 0.774      |\n"
"|       中横剖面系数 Cm       |  0.556 to 0.994      |\n"
"|       水线面系数 Cwp        |  0.662 to 0.841      |\n"
"|        水线半进角 ie        |    2.6 to 31.73 degr |\n"
"|      艉封板面积系数 Ta      |   0.00 to 0.74       |\n"
"|      艉封板宽度系数 Tw      |   0.00 to 1.00       |\n"
"|  排水体积/长度 DLR=V/Lwl^3  |  16.24 to 359.2      |\n"
"|         弗劳德数 Fr         |   0.15 to 0.90       |\n"
"+-----------------------------+----------------------+"

#. DeepSeek Flash review note: 源字符串标题为“Standart deviation”（拼写错误，应为 Standard
#. deviation），但俄语旧译文误作“参数范围”；已按源义统一为“标准偏差”。表格为等宽排版，各语言译文长度不同，需人工复核对齐；L/V**0,3333
#. 等公式与数值保持不变。
#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_hollen_note_p5
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_hollen_note_p5"
msgid ""
"5.Standart deviation of database for typical resistance Hollenbach's method:\n"
"+-------------+----------------------------------------+-------------------+\n"
"|             |            Single-screw ship           |                   |\n"
"| Character.  |-------------------+--------------------+  Twin-screw ship  |\n"
"|             |    Design draft   |   Ballast draft    |                   |\n"
"+-------------+-------------------+--------------------+-------------------+\n"
"| L/V**0,3333 |  4,490 ... 6,008  |  5,450 ... 7,047   |  4,405 ... 7,265  |\n"
"|     Cb      |  0,601 ... 0,830  |  0,559 ... 0,790   |  0,512 ... 0,775  |\n"
"|     L/B     |  4,710 ... 7,106  |  4,949 ... 6,623   |  3,960 ... 7,130  |\n"
"|     B/T     |  1,989 ... 4,002  |  2,967 ... 6,120   |  2,308 ... 6,110  |\n"
"|   Los/Lwl   |  1,000 ... 1,050  |  1,000 ... 1,050   |  1,000 ... 1,050  |\n"
"|   Lwl/L     |  1,000 ... 1,055  |  0,945 ... 1,000   |  1,000 ... 1,070  |\n"
"|    Dp/Ta    |  0,430 ... 0,840  |  0,655 ... 1,050   |  0,495 ... 0,860  |\n"
"+-------------+-------------------+--------------------+-------------------+"
msgstr ""
"5. Hollenbach 方法典型阻力数据库的标准偏差：\n"
"+-------------+----------------------------------------+-------------------+\n"
"|             |                 单桨船                 |                   |\n"
