#: freestringsunit.rs_resistance_mh_note
msgctxt "freestringsunit.rs_resistance_mh_note"
msgid ""
"1.Viscosity by default is for sea water with density 1025 kg/m^3 and temperature 15 °C.\n"
"You can change the temperature and the density: Project->Project Settings->Hydrostatics\n"
"2.The trim is calculated by formulaes: dT=Tf-Ta, Tf=T+dt/2, Ta=T-dt/2\n"
"3.Coefficient influence the after body form is from table:\n"
"+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"|                After body form                        |          Cstrn          |\n"
"+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"|              Normal sections                          |            0            |\n"
"|              V-shaped sections                        |           -10           |\n"
"|              U-shaped sections  (with Hogner stern)   |          5  ( 10 )      |\n"
"|              Barge type form                          |        -20  or -25      |\n"
"+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"4.In begining phase of ship design the wetted area S can be calculate for different types of ship and\n"
"hulls on this formulaes:\n"
"If S= 0, then S=L*(2*T+B)*sqrt(Cm)*(0,453+0,442*Cb-0,2862*Cm-0,003467*B/T+0,3696*Cwp) - by Holtrop\n"
"If S=-1, then S=L*(1,36*T+1,13*Cb*B) - by Muragin's formulae for ships with Cb=0,4...0,5 and B/T=2,5...3,5\n"
"If S=-2, then S=L*T*(2+1,37*(Cb-0,274)*B/T)     - by Semeka's formulae for ships with big Cb\n"
"If S=-3, then S=L*(Cb*B+1,7*T)                  - by Moomford's formulae for Cb=0,7 and B/T=2...3\n"
"If S=-4, then S=L*(B+2*T)*(0,76*Cb+0,28)        - by Benhe's formulae\n"
"If S=-5, then S=L*(0,85*B+0,25*T)               - for ship with transom\n"
"If S=-6, then S=V^0,6667*(5,1+0,074*L/T-0,4*Cb) - by Karpov's formulae for river ships w/o tonnels\n"
"If S=-7, then S=Lpp*(0.5*B+T)*(0.55+1.52*Cb)    - by Yeroshin's formulae for fishing ships\n"
"If S=-8, then S=V^0.3333*(3.4*V^0.3333+0.5*Lwl) - for cargo ships and ferries (Lap,1954)\n"
"If S=-9, then S=V/B*1.7/[Cb-0.2*(Cb-0.65)]+B/T  - for cargo ships and ferries (Danckwardt,1969)\n"
"If S=-10, then S=V/B*1.7/Cb+B/T*(0.92+0.092*Cb) - for trawlers (Danckwardt,1969)\n"
"If S=-11, then S=Lpp*(1.8*T+B*Cb)               - for modern warships (Schneekluth,1988)\n"
"If S=-12, then S=3,223*V^(2/3)+0,5402*Lwl*V^(1/3)- for tugs and trawlers (van Oortmerssen,1971)\n"
"If S=-13, then S=V(1/T+1,75/B/Cb)                - by Grigoriev formulae\n"
"If S=-14, then S=L(2*T + B)(0,654*Cb + 0,338)    - by Benge-Afanasiev formulae\n"
"If S=-15, then S=(0,085*B/T-2*Cb+3,29)(V*L)^0,5  - by Vashedchenko-1985 formulae\n"
"If S=-16, then S=L(2*T+B)(4,84*Cb-4,15*Cb^2-0,77)- for megayachts\n"
"\n"
"5.The wetted area of transom you can determine from sectional areas curve on Profile View or\n"
"from \"Design hydrostatics\" output.\n"
"The wetted area of bulbous on F.P. is analogous determination.\n"
"The CoG wetted bulb area h_b to determine on \"Bodyplan view\" visually.\n"
"6.Propeller number Np is set for power prediction and for interaction propeller and hull.\n"
"For Np=0 the wake fraction Wt and thrust deduction t is calculated as for highspeed sailing\n"
"ships.\n"
"7.Propeller diameter D with one-screw is <= 0.8*Ta, and for twin-screw <= 0.7*Ta.\n"
"Expanded blade area ratio Ae/Ao is calculate from condition, when cavitation be absent.\n"
"8.Absolutely rougness of hull less 150 mkm one can don't set.\n"
"9. Limitations of resistance calculation by OCT 5.0181-75 (xUSSR) and another methods are:\n"
"9.1 Series N 1 - high-speed and medium-rate ships: container carrier, Ro-Ro vessel, lighter carrier;\n"
"9.2 Series N 2 - passenger and cargopassenger ships:\n"
"9.3 Series N 3 - sea transport vessels: universal cargo vessels, middle tankers, bulkcarriers,\n"
"transport fishing, refrigerator ships;\n"
"9.4 Series N 4 - large displacement transport vessels: large tankers and ore-carriers;\n"
"Table. Standart deviation of database for typical resistance of series by OCT 5.0181-75 method\n"
"+-------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+\n"
"|  Parameter  |    Series 1     |    Series 2     |   Series 3      |    Series 4     |\n"
"+-------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+\n"
"|  Cb         | 0,500 ... 0,650 | 0,550 ... 0,650 | 0,600 ... 0,800 | 0,800 ... 0,875 |\n"
"|  Lpp/B      |  4,80 ... 7,00  |  4,80 ... 7,30  |        -        |  5,80 ... 8,30  |\n"
"|  B/T        |  2,00 ... 5,00  |  2,00 ... 5,00  |  2,00 ... 5,00  |  2,20 ... 3,50  |\n"
"|  Xc/Lpp     |        -        | -0,05 ... 0,00  |-0,025 ... 0,030 | 0,015 ... 0,044 |\n"
"|Psi=L/V^0.333|        -        |        -        |        -        |  5,00 ... 7,50  |\n"
"|  Fr         |  0,17 ... 0,34  |  0,17 ... 0,38  |  0,16 ... 0,30  |  0,10 ... 0,23  |\n"
"|  Nser       |        1        |        2        |        3        |        4        |\n"
"|  Np         |     1 ... 2     |        2        |        1        |        1        |\n"
"|  Nf         |       2,4       |        2        |      1,2,4      |     2 ... 5     |\n"
"|  Na         |        2        |        2        |        2        |     1 ... 3     |\n"
"+-------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+\n"
"Note: Np - propellers number; Nf - bow type; Na - stern type:\n"
"- Nf   = 1 ... 5 (U-shaped, V-shaped, cylinder-shaped (drum), ram-conical, bulbous bow);\n"
"- Na   = 1 ... 3 (U-shaped, V-shaped sections, cigar-shaped stern).\n"
"9.5 Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagrams of Braun:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed ships are in preplaning regime;\n"
"- Cb   = 0,290 ... 0,540;  L/B  = 3,50 ... 7,40;  B/T  = 3,10 ... 4,40;\n"
"- FrV  = v/(g*V^0,3333)^0,5 = 0,8 ... 2,6;\n"
"- Nser = 5 ;\n"
"- Np   = 1 ;\n"
"- Nf   = 1 ... 2 (U-shaped, V-shaped sections);\n"
"- Na   = 1 ... 2 (U-shaped, V-shaped sections).\n"
"9.6 Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagram of Neyman:\n"
"- type of ships - tugs, trawlers and icebreakers;\n"
"- Cp   = 0,500 ... 0,680;       B/T  =  2,4 ... 3,2;    Psi=L/V^0,333 = 4,00 ... 7,20;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,07 ... 0,45;\n"
"- Nser = 6 ;\n"
"- Nship= 1 ... 4 (1-tugs, 2-trawlers, 3 and 4-small warships);\n"
"- Np   = 1 ;\n"
"9.7 Calculation resistance and power prediction by a method of NIEWT (Russia):\n"
"- type of ships - cargo vessels for inland and mixed navigation (river-sea);\n"
"- Cp   = 0,800 ... 0,930;       L/B  = 4,00 ... 8,50;   B/T  = 3,70 ... 14,0;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,07 ... 0,25;\n"
"- Nser = 7 ;\n"
"- Np   = 1,2 ;\n"
"9.8 Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagram of Volodin:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed round-bilge boats;\n"
"9.9 Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagram of Nordstrom:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed round-bilge boats (14 models in 1936);\n"
"- V = 10 ... 30 m^3;\n"
"9.10  Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagrams of de Groot:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed round-bilge boats (31 models in 1951);\n"
"9.11 Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagrams of SSPA:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed round-bilge boats (9 models in 1968);\n"
"9.12 Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagrams of NPL:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed round-bilge boats (22 models in 1969 and 1976);\n"
"9.13 Calculation resistance and power prediction by diagrams 64 series Taylor's basin:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed round-bilge boats (27 models in 1965);\n"
"+---------+------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+--------------+------------+\n"
"|Parameter|  Volodin   |   Nordstrom   |   de Groote   |     SSPA      |     NPL      |  64 series |\n"
"+---------+------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+--------------+------------+\n"
"|   Cb    | 0,4...0,7  | 0,373... 0,41 | 0,293... 0,56 |      0,4      |    0,397     | 0,35...0,55|\n"
"|   Cp    |     -      | 0,576... 0,6  | 0,463...0,781 |      0,68     |    0,693     |     0,63   |\n"
"|   L/B   |     -      | 4,83 ... 6,94 | 3,53 ...10,09 | 4,62 ... 8,20 | 3,33 ...7,5  |8,45...18,26|\n"
"|   B/T   |     -      | 3,70 ... 14,0 | 2,72 ... 6,58 | 3.0; 3.5; 4.0 | 1,76 ... 6,87|2,0 ... 4,0 |\n"
"|  Xc/Lpp |     -      |-1,79 ... 2,88%|-11,5 ... 3,09%|       -       |     -6,4%    |Xg/Lpp=6,56%|\n"
"|   Psi   |     -      |       -       |       -       |    6; 7; 8    |       -      |     -      |\n"
"|   SVLR  |     -      | 2,67 ... 2,70 |      2,75     |  2,9 ... 3,0  |       -      |     -      |\n"
"|   a_f   |     -      | 15,1 ... 22,5°|       -       |  8,2 ... 14,4°|       -      | 3,7... 7,8°|\n"
"|   FrV   | 1,0...2,5  | 0,90 ... 2,00 |  0,8 ... 2,7  |  1,0 ... 2,0  |  0,5 ... 2,8 | 0,8... 3,0 |\n"
"| Cfo(Re) |   Pr-Shl   |     Pr-Shl    |     Pr-Shl    |  by ITTC-57   |  by ITTC-57  |    Pr-Shl  |\n"
"|   Nser  |     8      |       9       |      10       |       11      |       12     |      13    |\n"
"|   Np    |     1      |       1       |       1       |        1      |        1     |       1    |\n"
"+--------+------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+--------------+------------+\n"
"where FrV = v/(g*V^0,3333)^0,5 ;   SVLR = S/(VL)^0,5 ;   Pr-Shl - formulae by Prandl-Schlichting\n"
"9.14 Calculation resistance and power prediction by method of Doubrovsky:\n"
"- type of ships - displacement catamarans;\n"
"- Cb   = 0,3 ... 0,55 ;    C/L = 0,01 ... 0,15 ;   Psi  =  8,0 ... 18,0 ;\n"
"- FrV  = 0,8 ... 2,2;\n"
"- Nser = 14 ;\n"
"- Np   = 1 ... 2 - number of hulls ;\n"
"9.15 Calculation resistance and power prediction by method of Doubrovsky:\n"
"- type of ships - displacement catamarans and trimarans;\n"
"- Cb   = 0,35 ... 0,55 ;    S/Lwl = 0,15 ... 0,45 ;\n"
"- Psi  =  8,0 ... 18,0 ;     A/Lwl = 0,0  ... 0,5  (for S/Lwl = 0,3);\n"
"- Fr   = 0,25 ... 0,6;\n"
"- Nser = 15 ;\n"
"- Nh   = 1 ... 3 - number of hulls ;\n"
"9.16 Calculation resistance and power prediction by methods NIEWT, GIEWT and LIWT (Russia):\n"
"- type of ships - river cargoship, passenger, cargopassenger ships and tugs;\n"
"- Cb   = 0,40 ... 0,85 ;  L/B   =   4,0 ... 9,0 ;\n"
"- B/T  =  2,5 ... 7,5  ;  Lc/L  =   0,6 ... 0,85;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,05 ... 0,35 ;\n"
"- Nser = 16 ;\n"
"- Nsh  = 1 ... 3 - type of ships (1-cargoship, 2- tugs, 3- passenger and cargopassenger ships);\n"
"- Npr  = 1 ... 7 or 5 - number of ship prototype;\n"
"Table. Characteristics of ship's prototype for inland and mixed navigation (river-sea)\n"
"+-----+------+-------+-------+------+-----+------+-------+-------+-----+------+-------+-------+\n"
"|Numb.| L/B  |  T/B  |  Cb   | Lc/L |Numb.| L/B  |  T/B  |  Cb   |Numb.| L/B  |  T/B  |  Cb   |\n"
"+-----------------------------------+----------------------------+----------------------------+\n"
"|           Cargo ships             |        River tugs          |Passenger and cargopassenger|\n"
"+-----------------------------------+----------------------------+----------------------------+\n"
"|  1  | 8.18 | 0.212 | 0.851 | 0.79 |  1  | 4.99 | 0.243 | 0.545 |  1  | 7.75 | 0.190 | 0.575 |\n"
"|  2  | 6.93 | 0.216 | 0.837 | 0.76 |  2  | 4.73 | 0.253 | 0.557 |  2  | 8.10 | 0.198 | 0.710 |\n"
"|  3  | 7.02 | 0.204 | 0.830 | 0.75 |  3  | 5.02 | 0.243 | 0.636 |  3  | 6.60 | 0.202 | 0.573 |\n"
"|  4  | 7.95 | 0.266 | 0.869 | 0.78 |  4  | 4.60 | 0.400 | 0.522 |  4  | 5.72 | 0.249 | 0.465 |\n"
"|  5  | 6.74 | 0.225 | 0.800 | 0.75 |  5  | 5.13 | 0.275 | 0.535 |  5  | 4.73 | 0.202 | 0.581 |\n"
"|  6  | 8.50 | 0.266 | 0.818 | 0.80 |  6  | 4.70 | 0.244 | 0.618 |     |      |       |       |\n"
"|  7  | 6.11 | 0.184 | 0.788 | 0.76 |  7  | 4.04 | 0.135 | 0.528 |     |      |       |       |\n"
"+-----------------------------------+----------------------------+----------------------------+\n"
"9.17 Calculation resistance and power prediction by method Yeroshin:\n"
"- type of ships - fishing ships (SFT, MFT, BFT);\n"
"+---------+-----------------+------------------+-----------------+\n"
"| Charact.|      SFT        |       MFT        |      BFT        |\n"
"+---------+-----------------+------------------+-----------------+\n"
"|  Cp     |  0,50 ... 0,72  |  0,55 ... 0,70   |       -         |\n"
"|  Lpp/B  |   2,5 ... 3,5   |   3,5 ... 5,0    |       -         |\n"
"|  B/T    |   2,6 ... 4,0   |   2,3 ... 3,2    |       -         |\n"
"|  Cm     |  0,75 ... 0,92  |  0,65 ... 0,92   |       -         |\n"
"|  lcb    | -0,05 ...-0,01  | -0,03 ... 0,01   |       -         |\n"
"|  Fr     |   0,1 ... 0,5   |  0,21 ... 0,37   |       -         |\n"
"+---------+-----------------+------------------+-----------------+\n"
"NOTE: BFT series is NOT available now.\n"
"- Nser = 17 ;\n"
"- Nsh  = 1 ... 3 - type of fishing ship (1 - SFT, 2 - MFT, 3 - BFT);\n"
"9.18 Calculation resistance and power prediction by prototype:\n"
"- type of ships - highspeed sea ships w/o cylindrical body (Nm=1), tugs, icebreakers and fishing ships (Nm=2);\n"
"- For Nm=1, Cp =  0,5 ... 0,85 ;  B/T =   2 ... 14 ;  Psi = L/V^0,333 = 5 ... 11;  Fr = 0,25 ... 0,65 ;\n"
"- For Nm=2, Cb = 0,45 ... 0,55 ;  L/B = 3,5 ... 5,5;  B/T =  2,0 ... 3,5  ;        Fr = 0,10 ... 0,35 ;\n"
"- Nser = 18 ;\n"
"- Nm   = 1 ... 2  - method of calculation (1 - Geers, 2 - Doubrovin);\n"
"- Npr  = 0 ... 20 - number of prototype in BD, if 0, then to input manually.\n"
"9.19 Calculation resistance and power prediction by hard-chine catamarans:\n"
"- type of ships - displacement hard-chine catamarans;\n"
"- Cb   = 0,5 ... 0,6 ;   L/B = 10,0 ... 20,0 ;  B/T =  1,5 ... 2,5 ;  S/Lwl = 0,15 ... 0,55 ;\n"
"- Psi  = 6,6 ... 12,6;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,4 ... 1,5 ;\n"
"- Nser = 19 ;\n"
"- Nh   = 2 - number of hulls ;\n"
"10. Calculation resistance and power prediction by experimental model's data:\n"
"- type of ships - any displacement ships;\n"
"- Nser = 0 ;\n"
"NOTE: You must to set the coefficient of residual resistance Cr in function of Froude number Fr\n"
"Cr=f(Fr), where is Fr=v/(g*L)^0,5"
msgstr ""
"1.默认粘度对应海水，密度 1025 kg/m^3，温度 15 °C。\n"
"可修改温度和密度：项目->项目设置->静水力\n"
"2.纵倾按以下公式计算：dT=Tf-Ta, Tf=T+dt/2, Ta=T-dt/2\n"
"3.影响尾部形状的系数取自下表：\n"
"+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"|                尾部形状                        |          Cstrn          |\n"
"+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"|              正常剖面                                 |            0            |\n"
"|              V形剖面                                  |           -10           |\n"
"|              U形剖面（带Hogner尾）                     |          5  ( 10 )      |\n"
"|              驳船型                                   |        -20  或 -25      |\n"
"+-------------------------------------------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"4.在船舶设计初期，不同类型船舶和船体的湿表面积S可按以下公式计算：\n"
"船体按以下公式计算：\n"
"若 S= 0，则 S=L*(2*T+B)*sqrt(Cm)*(0,453+0,442*Cb-0,2862*Cm-0,003467*B/T+0,3696*Cwp) - Holtrop公式\n"
"若 S=-1，则 S=L*(1,36*T+1,13*Cb*B) - Muragin公式，适用于Cb=0,4...0,5且B/T=2,5...3,5的船舶\n"
"若 S=-2，则 S=L*T*(2+1,37*(Cb-0,274)*B/T)     - Semeka公式，适用于大Cb船舶\n"
"若 S=-3，则 S=L*(Cb*B+1,7*T)                  - Moomford公式，适用于Cb=0,7且B/T=2...3\n"
"若 S=-4，则 S=L*(B+2*T)*(0,76*Cb+0,28)        - Benhe公式\n"
"若 S=-5，则 S=L*(0,85*B+0,25*T)               - 适用于带方尾的船舶\n"
"若 S=-6，则 S=V^0,6667*(5,1+0,074*L/T-0,4*Cb) - Karpov公式，适用于无隧道的内河船舶\n"
"若 S=-7，则 S=Lpp*(0.5*B+T)*(0.55+1.52*Cb)    - 按 Yeroshin 渔船公式\n"
"若 S=-8，则 S=V^0.3333*(3.4*V^0.3333+0.5*Lwl) - 适用于货船和渡船 (Lap,1954)\n"
"若 S=-9，则 S=V/B*1.7/[Cb-0.2*(Cb-0.65)]+B/T  - 适用于货船和渡船 (Danckwardt,1969)\n"
"若 S=-10，则 S=V/B*1.7/Cb+B/T*(0.92+0.092*Cb) - 适用于拖网渔船 (Danckwardt,1969)\n"
"若 S=-11，则 S=Lpp*(1.8*T+B*Cb)               - 适用于现代军舰 (Schneekluth,1988)\n"
"若 S=-12，则 S=3,223*V^(2/3)+0,5402*Lwl*V^(1/3)- 适用于拖船和拖网渔船 (van Oortmerssen,1971)\n"
"若 S=-13，则 S=V(1/T+1,75/B/Cb)                - 按 Grigoriev 公式\n"
"若 S=-14，则 S=L(2*T + B)(0,654*Cb + 0,338)    - 按 Benge-Afanasiev 公式\n"
"若 S=-15，则 S=(0,085*B/T-2*Cb+3,29)(V*L)^0,5  - 按 Vashedchenko-1985 公式\n"
"若 S=-16，则 S=L(2*T+B)(4,84*Cb-4,15*Cb^2-0,77)- 适用于大型游艇\n"
"\n"
"5.艉封板的湿表面积可从纵剖视图上的横剖面面积曲线确定，或\n"
"从“Design hydrostatics”输出中获取。\n"
"艏垂线处球鼻艏的湿表面积可用类似方法确定。\n"
"球鼻艏湿表面积的重心高度 h_b 可在“Bodyplan view”中目视确定。\n"
"6.螺旋桨数 Np 用于功率预报以及螺旋桨与船体的相互作用计算。\n"
"当 Np=0 时，伴流分数 Wt 和推力减额 t 按高速帆船计算，\n"
"船舶。\n"
"7.单螺旋桨的螺旋桨直径 D <= 0.8*Ta，双螺旋桨 <= 0.7*Ta。\n"
"当不存在空泡时，按条件计算展开桨叶面积比 Ae/Ao。\n"
"8.若船体绝对粗糙度小于 150 mkm，可以不设置。\n"
"9. 按 OCT 5.0181-75（前苏联）及其他方法进行阻力计算的限制条件为：\n"
"9.1 系列 N 1——高速及中速船舶：集装箱船、Ro-Ro 船、载驳船；\n"
"9.2 系列 N 2——客船及客货船：\n"
"9.3 系列 N 3——海运运输船：通用货船、中型油船、散货船，\n"
"运输渔船、冷藏船；\n"
"9.4 系列 N 4——大型排水量运输船：大型油船和矿砂船；\n"
"表. 按 OCT 5.0181-75 方法各系列典型阻力的数据库标准偏差\n"
"+-------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+\n"
"|  Parameter  |    Series 1     |    Series 2     |   Series 3      |    Series 4     |\n"
"+-------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+\n"
"|  Cb         | 0,500 ... 0,650 | 0,550 ... 0,650 | 0,600 ... 0,800 | 0,800 ... 0,875 |\n"
"|  Lpp/B      |  4,80 ... 7,00  |  4,80 ... 7,30  |        -        |  5,80 ... 8,30  |\n"
"|  B/T        |  2,00 ... 5,00  |  2,00 ... 5,00  |  2,00 ... 5,00  |  2,20 ... 3,50  |\n"
"|  Xc/Lpp     |        -        | -0,05 ... 0,00  |-0,025 ... 0,030 | 0,015 ... 0,044 |\n"
"|Psi=L/V^0.333|        -        |        -        |        -        |  5,00 ... 7,50  |\n"
"|  Fr         |  0,17 ... 0,34  |  0,17 ... 0,38  |  0,16 ... 0,30  |  0,10 ... 0,23  |\n"
"|  Nser       |        1        |        2        |        3        |        4        |\n"
"|  Np         |     1 ... 2     |        2        |        1        |        1        |\n"
"|  Nf         |       2,4       |        2        |      1,2,4      |     2 ... 5     |\n"
"|  Na         |        2        |        2        |        2        |     1 ... 3     |\n"
"+-------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------+\n"
"注：Np - 螺旋桨数量；Nf - 船首类型；Na - 船尾类型：\n"
"- Nf   = 1 ... 5 (U形、V形、圆筒形（鼓形）、冲角锥形、球鼻首)；\n"
"- Na   = 1 ... 3 (U形、V形横剖面、雪茄形船尾)。\n"
"9.5 按 Braun 图谱计算阻力与功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 高速船处于预滑行状态；\n"
"- Cb   = 0,290 ... 0,540;  L/B  = 3,50 ... 7,40;  B/T  = 3,10 ... 4,40;\n"
"- FrV  = v/(g*V^0,3333)^0,5 = 0,8 ... 2,6;\n"
"- Nser = 5 ;\n"
"- Np   = 1 ;\n"
"- Nf   = 1 ... 2 (U形、V形横剖面)；\n"
"- Na   = 1 ... 2 (U形、V形横剖面)。\n"
"9.6 按 Neyman 图谱计算阻力与功率预报：\n"
"- 船舶类型——拖船、拖网渔船和破冰船；\n"
"- Cp   = 0,500 ... 0,680;       B/T  =  2,4 ... 3,2;    Psi=L/V^0,333 = 4,00 ... 7,20;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,07 ... 0,45;\n"
"- Nser = 6 ;\n"
"- Nship= 1 ... 4 (1-拖船，2-拖网渔船，3 和 4-小型军舰)；\n"
"- Np   = 1 ;\n"
"9.7 按 NIEWT 法（俄罗斯）计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船舶类型——内河及江海联运（河-海）货船；\n"
"- Cp   = 0,800 ... 0,930;       L/B  = 4,00 ... 8,50;   B/T  = 3,70 ... 14,0;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,07 ... 0,25;\n"
"- Nser = 7 ;\n"
"- Np   = 1,2 ;\n"
"9.8 按 Volodin 图谱计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船舶类型——高速圆舭艇；\n"
"9.9 按 Nordstrom 图谱计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船舶类型——高速圆舭艇（1936 年，14 个模型）；\n"
"- V = 10 ... 30 m^3;\n"
"9.10  按 de Groot 图谱计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 高速圆舭艇（1951年31个模型）；\n"
"9.11 按 SSPA 图谱计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 高速圆舭艇（1968年9个模型）；\n"
"9.12 按 NPL 图谱计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 高速圆舭艇（1969年和1976年22个模型）；\n"
"9.13 按 64 系列泰勒水池图谱计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 高速圆舭艇（1965年27个模型）；\n"
"+---------+------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+--------------+------------+\n"
"|Parameter|  Volodin   |   Nordstrom   |   de Groote   |     SSPA      |     NPL      |  64 series |\n"
"+---------+------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+--------------+------------+\n"
"|   Cb    | 0,4...0,7  | 0,373... 0,41 | 0,293... 0,56 |      0,4      |    0,397     | 0,35...0,55|\n"
"|   Cp    |     -      | 0,576... 0,6  | 0,463...0,781 |      0,68     |    0,693     |     0,63   |\n"
"|   L/B   |     -      | 4,83 ... 6,94 | 3,53 ...10,09 | 4,62 ... 8,20 | 3,33 ...7,5  |8,45...18,26|\n"
"|   B/T   |     -      | 3,70 ... 14,0 | 2,72 ... 6,58 | 3.0; 3.5; 4.0 | 1,76 ... 6,87|2,0 ... 4,0 |\n"
"|  Xc/Lpp |     -      |-1,79 ... 2,88%|-11,5 ... 3,09%|       -       |     -6,4%    |Xg/Lpp=6,56%|\n"
"|   Psi   |     -      |       -       |       -       |    6; 7; 8    |       -      |     -      |\n"
"|   SVLR  |     -      | 2,67 ... 2,70 |      2,75     |  2,9 ... 3,0  |       -      |     -      |\n"
"|   a_f   |     -      | 15,1 ... 22,5°|       -       |  8,2 ... 14,4°|       -      | 3,7... 7,8°|\n"
"|   FrV   | 1,0...2,5  | 0,90 ... 2,00 |  0,8 ... 2,7  |  1,0 ... 2,0  |  0,5 ... 2,8 | 0,8... 3,0 |\n"
"| Cfo(Re) |   Pr-Shl   |     Pr-Shl    |     Pr-Shl    |  by ITTC-57   |  by ITTC-57  |    Pr-Shl  |\n"
"|   Nser  |     8      |       9       |      10       |       11      |       12     |      13    |\n"
"|   Np    |     1      |       1       |       1       |        1      |        1     |       1    |\n"
"+--------+------------+---------------+---------------+---------------+--------------+------------+\n"
"其中 FrV = v/(g*V^0,3333)^0,5 ；   SVLR = S/(VL)^0,5 ；   Pr-Shl - 按 Prandl-Schlichting 公式\n"
"9.14 按 Doubrovsky 方法计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 排水量双体船；\n"
"- Cb   = 0,3 ... 0,55 ;    C/L = 0,01 ... 0,15 ;   Psi  =  8,0 ... 18,0 ;\n"
"- FrV  = 0,8 ... 2,2;\n"
"- Nser = 14 ;\n"
"- Np   = 1 ... 2 - 船体数量；\n"
"9.15 按 Doubrovsky 方法计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 排水量双体船和三体船；\n"
"- Cb   = 0,35 ... 0,55 ;    S/Lwl = 0,15 ... 0,45 ;\n"
"- Psi  =  8,0 ... 18,0 ;     A/Lwl = 0,0  ... 0,5  (对于 S/Lwl = 0,3);\n"
"- Fr   = 0,25 ... 0,6;\n"
"- Nser = 15 ;\n"
"- Nh   = 1 ... 3 - 船体数量 ;\n"
"9.16 按 NIEWT、GIEWT 和 LIWT 方法（俄罗斯）计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船型 - 内河货船、客船、客货船和拖船；\n"
"- Cb   = 0,40 ... 0,85 ;  L/B   =   4,0 ... 9,0 ;\n"
"- B/T  =  2,5 ... 7,5  ;  Lc/L  =   0,6 ... 0,85;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,05 ... 0,35 ;\n"
"- Nser = 16 ;\n"
"- Nsh  = 1 ... 3 - 船型（1-货船，2-拖船，3-客船和客货船）；\n"
"- Npr  = 1 ... 7 或 5 - 母型船编号；\n"
"表. 内河及混合航行（河-海）母型船特征\n"
"+-----+------+-------+-------+------+-----+------+-------+-------+-----+------+-------+-------+\n"
"|Numb.| L/B  |  T/B  |  Cb   | Lc/L |Numb.| L/B  |  T/B  |  Cb   |Numb.| L/B  |  T/B  |  Cb   |\n"
"+-----------------------------------+----------------------------+----------------------------+\n"
"|           货船                    |        内河拖船            |客船和客货船                |\n"
"+-----------------------------------+----------------------------+----------------------------+\n"
"|  1  | 8.18 | 0.212 | 0.851 | 0.79 |  1  | 4.99 | 0.243 | 0.545 |  1  | 7.75 | 0.190 | 0.575 |\n"
"|  2  | 6.93 | 0.216 | 0.837 | 0.76 |  2  | 4.73 | 0.253 | 0.557 |  2  | 8.10 | 0.198 | 0.710 |\n"
"|  3  | 7.02 | 0.204 | 0.830 | 0.75 |  3  | 5.02 | 0.243 | 0.636 |  3  | 6.60 | 0.202 | 0.573 |\n"
"|  4  | 7.95 | 0.266 | 0.869 | 0.78 |  4  | 4.60 | 0.400 | 0.522 |  4  | 5.72 | 0.249 | 0.465 |\n"
"|  5  | 6.74 | 0.225 | 0.800 | 0.75 |  5  | 5.13 | 0.275 | 0.535 |  5  | 4.73 | 0.202 | 0.581 |\n"
"|  6  | 8.50 | 0.266 | 0.818 | 0.80 |  6  | 4.70 | 0.244 | 0.618 |     |      |       |       |\n"
"|  7  | 6.11 | 0.184 | 0.788 | 0.76 |  7  | 4.04 | 0.135 | 0.528 |     |      |       |       |\n"
"+-----------------------------------+----------------------------+----------------------------+\n"
"9.17 按 Yeroshin 法计算阻力与功率预报：\n"
"- 船舶类型 - 渔船（SFT、MFT、BFT）；\n"
"+---------+-----------------+------------------+-----------------+\n"
"| Charact.|      SFT        |       MFT        |      BFT        |\n"
"+---------+-----------------+------------------+-----------------+\n"
"|  Cp     |  0,50 ... 0,72  |  0,55 ... 0,70   |       -         |\n"
"|  Lpp/B  |   2,5 ... 3,5   |   3,5 ... 5,0    |       -         |\n"
"|  B/T    |   2,6 ... 4,0   |   2,3 ... 3,2    |       -         |\n"
"|  Cm     |  0,75 ... 0,92  |  0,65 ... 0,92   |       -         |\n"
"|  lcb    | -0,05 ...-0,01  | -0,03 ... 0,01   |       -         |\n"
"|  Fr     |   0,1 ... 0,5   |  0,21 ... 0,37   |       -         |\n"
"+---------+-----------------+------------------+-----------------+\n"
"注意：BFT 系列目前不可用。\n"
"- Nser = 17 ;\n"
"- Nsh  = 1 ... 3 - 渔船类型（1 - SFT，2 - MFT，3 - BFT）；\n"
"9.18 按母型船计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船舶类型 - 无圆柱体的高速海船（Nm=1）、拖船、破冰船和渔船（Nm=2）；\n"
"- 当 Nm=1 时，Cp =  0,5 ... 0,85 ;  B/T =   2 ... 14 ;  Psi = L/V^0,333 = 5 ... 11;  Fr = 0,25 ... 0,65 ;\n"
"- 当 Nm=2 时，Cb = 0,45 ... 0,55 ;  L/B = 3,5 ... 5,5;  B/T =  2,0 ... 3,5  ;        Fr = 0,10 ... 0,35 ;\n"
"- Nser = 18 ;\n"
"- Nm   = 1 ... 2  - 计算方法（1 - Geers，2 - Doubrovin）；\n"
"- Npr  = 0 ... 20 - 数据库中的原型编号，若为 0 则手动输入。\n"
"9.19 按折角型双体船计算阻力和功率预报：\n"
"- 船舶类型 - 排水型折角型双体船；\n"
"- Cb   = 0,5 ... 0,6 ;   L/B = 10,0 ... 20,0 ;  B/T =  1,5 ... 2,5 ;  S/Lwl = 0,15 ... 0,55 ;\n"
"- Psi  = 6,6 ... 12,6;\n"
"- Fr   = 0,4 ... 1,5 ;\n"
"- Nser = 19 ;\n"
"- Nh   = 2 - 船体数量；\n"
"10. 根据试验模型数据进行阻力和功率预报计算：\n"
"- 船型 - 任意排水型船；\n"
"- Nser = 0 ;\n"
"注意：必须将剩余阻力系数 Cr 设为傅汝德数 Fr 的函数\n"
"Cr=f(Fr)，其中 Fr=v/(g*L)^0,5"

