msgid "Unrolled edge length minus original 3D length. Positive means longer; negative means shorter."
msgstr "展开后边长减去原三维边长。正值表示变长，负值表示变短。"

msgid "Largest absolute face area difference between the unrolled plate and the 3D surface."
msgstr "各面的展开面积与原三维面积之差的最大绝对值。"

msgid "Signed area difference: unrolled minus 3D. Positive and negative face differences can cancel."
msgstr "有符号面积差：展开面积减去三维面积。各面的正负差值可能互相抵消。"

msgid "Sum of absolute face area differences: %s %s. Normalized comparison score: %s. These are geometric errors, not material or manufacturing tolerances."
